}# Phase 12 Optional Writer Review Packet

This study is **optional and NOT_RUN** under D046. It must not block engineering completion.

If commissioned, use rights-cleared writer-owned material and ask one discovery-oriented writer and one outline-oriented writer to complete the same small scene-exploration task. Preserve the original material, rejected alternatives and exact interaction record. Record separately: whether the workflow forced an unwanted process, whether alternatives were meaningfully distinct, whether protected material survived, what was rejected and why, and whether either writer kept the original.

Do not turn the observations into a screenplay score, population claim, endorsement, or model-quality claim. Provider-free and generated conditions must be labeled separately.{
